# Defra content

Follow the GOV.UK style guide, plus the Defra style guide for Defra-specific words and patterns: <https://digital.defra.gov.uk/content/defra-style-guide>

That guide is currently written mainly for livestock, agriculture, and flood terminology. If a project uses sector-specific terms it doesn't cover, agree the wording once with the project team and record it in that project's rules rather than inventing phrasing per page.
